1️⃣ User clicks link → browser requests /students
2️⃣ DispatcherServlet receives request
3️⃣ Finds controller with @GetMapping("/students")
4️⃣ Controller loads business data
5️⃣ Returns HTML page students.html
6️⃣ Browser displays student table
